        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Use good tinned tomatoes and cook the sauce over high heat so it reduces quickly. The garlic should turn golden but not brown. Brown garlic turns bitter."
          }
        ]
      },
